{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id937922109"}, "name":{"label":"CHAU DANH TUAN"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-07T12:55:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.34.2"}, "id":{"label":"13110918228"}, "title":{"label":"not satisfied with the handling of the booking application"}, "content":{"label":"I just encountered a case because I booked the wrong ticket on October 30, 2025 from Bangkok to Ho Chi Minh City and bought an additional 23kg checked baggage and the airline gave me an additional 23kg checked baggage and a total of 46kg checked baggage, and because I booked the wrong ticket and I asked trip.com to change the ticket to September 30, 2025. Trip.com asked me to pay more money but the 23kg checked baggage I bought was not included in the ticket I changed. According to everyone, is trip.com's handling like this blatantly deceiving customers?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=681752345&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
