{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id302997331"}, "name":{"label":"Bunrieu238"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-01T19:45:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.34.0"}, "id":{"label":"13088558477"}, "title":{"label":"Bad"}, "content":{"label":"\"I bought a ticket and cancelled it. I received an email notification that I lost half the money because I bought a ticket but couldn't go, and that I needed support from the app. My family member got to the airport, but the US side wouldn't allow transit, forcing me to forfeit the ticket. I went back on the app to get a refund and choose another ticket, but they didn't accept my involuntary cancellation and forced me to voluntarily cancel, even though we didn't want to cancel. I accepted the voluntary cancellation and was supposed to receive 10,900,000, but currently, the amount in my account is 10,780,100. What fee did I lose? There was no explanation for me. The way they forced me to voluntarily cancel is really terrible for a customer like me.\"", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=681752345&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
