{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1741235353"}, "name":{"label":"Cyan2205"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-05T21:17:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.32.0"}, "id":{"label":"12981527331"}, "title":{"label":"A bad refund experience"}, "content":{"label":"[Updated on 6Aug2025]\nThe case was resolved on 9 July after a 3-time escalation. However, I am satisfied with the result and the effort of the Trip.com team in the last attempt to solve my case.\n\n[Original comment]\nI booked a buffet ticket to sit on the balcony on the 81st floor of Baiyoke Hotel Thailand on June 28, because it was raining, so the supplier called me to offer me to sit in the indoor area on the 82nd floor with a cheaper ticket price, the difference between the 2 packages is nearly 1.1 million VND. I mentioned that the supplier could cancel the booking and I would buy the ticket again, but the supplier refused and promised to refund me. I believed in Trip's service quality, so I agreed with this plan. However, when contacting Trip about this refund issue, at first, Trip offered a refund worth nearly 743k VND, which means that I lost 30%, so I did not accept and asked Trip to check again. Today, after 1 week of review, Trip decided to refund me 630k. It's unbelievable that I should have been refunded 1 million VND, but now it's 630k after 2 reviews, just because I trusted Trip.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=681752345&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
